        <mxCell id="note" value="Role model: USER.role = STUDENT / TA / INSTRUCTOR / ADMIN. All users sign in through one flow. COURSE_STAFF_ASSIGNMENT grants course-scoped staff access. ASSIGNMENT.created_by records the staff author. Accepted assignment uploads are final files; each accepted resubmission creates a new immutable version and receipt. There are no assignment grades, scores, feedback, or GRADED status. Academic data remains generic/simulated." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6EAD9;strokeColor=#C99A53;fontColor=#4D2E20;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
